B.Gh=new A.hx("announcement_wifi_maintenance","Campus Wi-Fi maintenance notice","IT Services","27 October 2026","A short maintenance window is planned for the campus wireless network this evening.","The IITU campus wireless network will undergo scheduled demonstration maintenance on 27 October from 19:00 to 20:30. Short interruptions may affect student Wi-Fi in study areas and shared spaces. Students are advised to save cloud work before the maintenance window and use mobile data for urgent online activity. Normal service is expected to resume after the maintenance is completed. This notice is fictional demonstration content created for the Campus Content Lists and Grids practical task.",B.PB,!0)
