B.Gb=new A.hx("announcement_library_hours","Library study hours extended","Library","26 October 2026","The library will stay open later during the upcoming assessment period.","For the upcoming assessment period, the demonstration library schedule has been extended to give students more time for individual and group study. Quiet study areas and selected collaboration spaces will remain available until 21:00 on weekdays. Students should bring their university ID when entering after normal office hours. This is fictional demonstration data for the practical exercise.",B.mL,!1)
