B.Gf=new A.hx("announcement_registration_deadline","Spring course registration deadline","Academic","24 October 2026","Students should review their planned modules before the demonstration registration deadline.","Students are reminded to review their planned spring modules and complete the demonstration course registration process before the listed deadline. Check prerequisites, timetable conflicts and credit requirements before confirming a selection. Students who need academic guidance can contact the Academic Office through the campus services page. This announcement is fictional and is used only as demonstration content.",B.jd,!1)
B.Ga=new A.hx("announcement_midterm_week","Midterm examination week reminder","Academic","22 October 2026","Check your timetable, room details and student ID before each scheduled assessment.","The demonstration midterm examination week is approaching. Students should check the latest timetable, confirm the room for each assessment and arrive with a valid student ID. Personal devices should be stored according to the instructions given by the lecturer. Any timetable questions should be raised with the relevant academic office before the examination day. This notice is fictional demonstration content.",B.rD,!1)
B.rO=new A.aw(983750,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.Ge=new A.hx("announcement_career_registration","Career fair registration is open","Career","20 October 2026","Students can register for CV reviews, employer talks and internship information sessions.","Registration is open for the fictional IITU Career Fair programme. Demonstration activities include short employer presentations, CV review appointments and internship information sessions. Students are encouraged to prepare a short introduction and an updated CV before attending. More information can be found through the Career Services tile on the Services page. This notice is demonstration data only.",B.rO,!1)
B.Gg=new A.hx("announcement_id_renewal","Student ID card renewal reminder","Student Services","18 October 2026","Students with expiring or damaged cards can prepare a renewal request through campus support.","Students whose demonstration student ID card is expiring or damaged are reminded to prepare a renewal request. Bring the required identification information and check the service instructions before visiting the support desk. If a card has been lost, students can also submit a campus service request through the Services page. This is fictional demonstration content for the practical task.",B.mI,!1)
