B.Gc=new A.hx("announcement_accommodation_check","Accommodation maintenance check","Accommodation","15 October 2026","A routine demonstration maintenance check is planned for selected student accommodation areas.","A routine fictional maintenance check is planned for selected student accommodation areas. The demonstration check covers common lighting, water fixtures and shared facilities. Students who notice a separate room issue can use the Accommodation service information or submit a service request from the campus app. This announcement is fictional demonstration data.",B.rC,!1)
